14
00:01:32,080 --> 00:01:32,160
Yeah.

15
00:01:32,640 --> 00:01:40,320
So I think there's a lot of like, you know, UA experts out there and a lot of people obviously who work in apps.

16
00:01:40,800 --> 00:01:45,520
I guess my speciality lies within Google App Campaigns, their ads product.

17
