And for a long time they launched it, they finally, finally back in July of 2024 started to roll it out and actually prompt for consent on the YouTube app.

270
00:26:14,960 --> 00:26:18,800
But I noticed even still, Google does phased rollouts of everything.

271
00:26:19,200 --> 00:26:19,360
Right.

272
00:26:19,520 --> 00:26:23,200
So they'll do like they'll launch it to like one percent of users in one country.

273
00:26:23,600 --> 00:26:23,680
Right.

274
00:26:23,920 --> 00:26:25,600
And then they slowly bring it out.

275
00:26:25,840 --> 00:26:27,760
I didn't actually, they launched that in July.

