00:26:31,600 --> 00:26:33,440
Like they hadn't even shown it to everybody.

278
00:26:33,840 --> 00:26:49,520
So anyway, that's all to say that like Google, because of their traffic differences and the choices that they made, you know, back in 2021, people don't understand like why those decisions had a big impact on the, the measurement side of things.

