00:28:55,760 --> 00:28:57,680
Lowly, slow.

312
00:28:58,480 --> 00:29:02,640
You don't want to, like, you know, wake the dragon or whatever it is.

313
00:29:03,360 --> 00:29:08,880
And I've experienced this personally where I've always the the engineers at Google were always like twenty percent, right?

314
00:29:09,360 --> 00:29:14,080
No more than twenty percent in any given day on bids and budgets up or down.

315
00:29:14,800 --> 00:29:21,200
And so if you are looking to scale, I kind of got burned not that long ago where I was like, I bet I could push it like a little bit more.

316
00:29:21,840 --> 00:29:22,640
And then I did.

317
00:29:23,360 --> 00:29:26,480
And what happens is that the the system goes, goes crazy.

318
00:29:27,040 --> 00:29:32,960
It's like, woohoo, we got it like a ten year old or something that just got more money is like, let's go spend it.

319
00:29:33,120 --> 00:29:34,000
Let's go figure it out.

320
00:29:34,240 --> 00:29:36,720
It's like, whoa, we have to be cautious.

321
00:29:37,280 --> 00:29:43,120
Let's take, you know, let's try and figure out new pockets of inventory and do this in a responsible manner.

322
00:29:43,760 --> 00:29:46,480
And so, yeah, that twenty percent rule does really apply.

323
00:29:46,720 --> 00:29:54,240
And I even am maybe more conservative where I only adjust it or I try to only adjust it by twenty percent every two to three days.

324
00:29:54,480 --> 00:30:00,240
I try not to do it every single day because then it just keeps kicking it back into learning mode at too great a frequency.

325
00:30:00,640 --> 00:30:11,920
We'll dive more into campaign management a bit, but with that budget, would that be on like one campaign or can you have multiple campaigns running at the same time with that $500 just getting started budget?

326
00:30:12,480 --> 00:30:13,360
That's one campaign.

327
00:30:14,080 --> 00:30:19,920
But you really don't need more than one campaign if you're only targeting one geography.

328
00:30:20,640 --> 00:30:29,520
So if you just have one US based campaign, actually the guidance is to not have a duplicate one doing exactly the same thing.

329
00:30:30,080 --> 00:30:35,840
There's a lot of theories out there that like you're cannibalizing your traffic if you do that.

330
00:30:36,320 --> 00:30:42,080
