331
00:30:42,480 --> 00:30:44,560
That's what the we called them GTech.

332
00:30:44,880 --> 00:30:49,440
That was the internal team, the Google Tech team would come back and say, well, it's because they have multiple campaigns.

333
00:30:49,920 --> 00:30:53,360
But that was always, I think, really hard to prove that that was the case.

334
00:30:53,760 --> 00:30:58,480
But if you're going to set up your campaigns, you only need one campaign per geo.

335
00:30:59,520 --> 00:30:59,600
Okay.

336
00:31:00,000 --> 00:31:12,640
And then if you do want to get more granular, like you could have a separate one if you were doing different bid types, like if you're optimizing for installs versus, let's say, start trials, you would have two separate campaigns because you do have to set your.

337
00:31:13,520 --> 00:31:15,840
event optimization at the campaign level.

338
00:31:16,400 --> 00:31:17,360
That's pretty rare too.

