00:33:37,840 --> 00:33:46,400
Text assets, by the way, are like the most crucial part of your Google Ads campaigns, contrary to maybe other platforms where people are not even reading it.

370
00:33:46,800 --> 00:33:50,240
It's like the text asset is just like fundamental.

371
00:33:50,480 --> 00:33:56,720
And again, if you're thinking about search, search only shows text, right, search assets, right?

372
00:33:56,960 --> 00:33:59,280
Like that's just a text strategy.

373
00:33:59,520 --> 00:34:02,000
So you've got to make sure that that's really fine tuned.

