00:34:11,920 --> 00:34:15,360
And that's what your asset, the total asset is.

376
00:34:15,680 --> 00:34:22,800
And so I think a lot of people often times like overlook them or they use Google's recommendations to put their tax assets.

377
00:34:23,120 --> 00:34:34,000
And I don't know why Google doesn't abide by regular punctuation and grammar in those, but anyway, the tax assets is really, really critical.

