00:34:34,800 --> 00:34:49,760
The other piece that I talk a lot about, again, going back to understanding what Google's traffic is, I think it's really easy to see in, again, like Facebook or Instagram that, oh, you always get a 15 or 20 seconds real.

379
00:34:50,720 --> 00:34:52,640
Okay, and like that's what you see quite often.

