598
00:54:41,600 --> 00:54:50,720
But I think with subscription apps, they've had sort of like a 50/50 hit rate on whether or not that bid type can work for their business model.

599
00:54:51,680 --> 00:54:57,600
So for that one, if you're feeling like you're being pushed at all on it, I think it's okay to be skeptical.

600
00:54:58,000 --> 00:55:00,080
But at the same time, it has worked for some folks.

