00:56:00,880 --> 00:56:02,080
You got the budget for it.

620
00:56:02,400 --> 00:56:04,080
And then we're going to give you the support.

621
00:56:04,240 --> 00:56:06,160
You know, we're paying these people X amount of money.

622
00:56:06,240 --> 00:56:08,000
Like we got to make sure it's worth it for us.

623
00:56:08,560 --> 00:56:10,000
So that's really how you get it.

624
00:56:10,160 --> 00:56:14,320
The one thing I would call out though is that like you're that depends on your market.

625
00:56:15,280 --> 00:56:20,960
And ultimately, you get assigned based on your billing country that you have set up in your Google Ads account.

626
00:56:21,040 --> 00:56:24,640
