00:57:04,960 --> 00:57:07,120
You call them book refreshes, right?

641
00:57:07,360 --> 00:57:13,440
This is when the reps actually like they have their assigned book of accounts that they work with and their goals against.

642
00:57:14,160 --> 00:57:15,600
